"\`\`\`iec61131
speed : REAL
\`\`\`

_struct field_

---

**REAL** — _data-type_

IEEE 754 single-precision, 32-bit. ~7 significant digits.

**Gotchas**
- Math results depend on target FPU. Bit-exact equality is fragile across controllers.
- REAL → integer conversion is undefined behavior if value is out of range.

_Source: [docs/codesys-reference/06-data-types.md](https://content.helpme-codesys.com/en/CODESYS%20Development%20System/_cds_reference_datatypes.html)_"
